@startuml domain-class
title Quiz Buzzer (課堂搶答系統) - Domain Classes (models.py; 001 + 002 + 003)

skinparam shadowing false
skinparam defaultFontName "Microsoft JhengHei"
hide empty methods

enum Phase {
  DRAFT
  OPEN
  CLOSED
}

enum UnitKind {
  SINGLE
  GROUP_SET
}

class Activity {
  id : int
  title : str
  phase : Phase
  groupCount : int {2..12}
  sourceSpreadsheetId : str
  sourceSheetId : int
  sourceTabTitle : str
  createdAt : str {ISO-8601 UTC}
  importedAt : str {ISO-8601 UTC}
}

class QuestionUnit {
  id : int
  number : int {>0}
  kind : UnitKind
  sourceRow : int
  position : int
}

class AnswerSlot {
  id : int
  subPart : int {>0}
  cellRow : int
  cellColumn : int
  a1Ref : str
}

class Group <<value>> {
  number : int {1..groupCount}
}

class Participant {
  id : int
  displayName : str {1..20 chars, trimmed}
  joinedAt : str {ISO-8601 UTC}
  tokenHash : str
}

class Submission {
  id : int
  rank : int {>=1}
  receivedAt : str {ISO-8601 UTC, server}
  isWinner() : bool {rank = 1}
}

class SubmissionAnswer {
  text : str {1..200 chars, trimmed}
}

Activity "1" *-- "1..*" QuestionUnit : questions >
QuestionUnit "1" *-- "1..*" AnswerSlot : slots >
Activity "1" *-- "2..12" Group : groups >
Group "1" *-- "0..*" Participant : members >
QuestionUnit "1" *-- "0..*" Submission : submissions >
Group "1" -- "0..*" Submission : submits >
Participant "1" -- "0..*" Submission : submittedBy <
Submission "1" *-- "1..*" SubmissionAnswer : answers >
SubmissionAnswer "0..*" --> "1" AnswerSlot : for slot >
Activity --> Phase
QuestionUnit --> UnitKind

note right of Activity
  At most one Activity is non-CLOSED
  (DRAFT or OPEN) at a time.
  CLOSED activities are kept, with
  results / CSV viewable (003).
  Phase: DRAFT -> OPEN -> CLOSED, forward
  only, one step at a time (002).
  A DRAFT activity may be cancelled: it is
  deleted with its units, slots, groups and
  participants (no submissions can exist).
  OPEN / CLOSED activities are never deleted.
  Slots live on the activity's source
  tab (sourceSheetId / sourceTabTitle).
end note

note right of AnswerSlot
  Cell location (1-based row/column)
  computed at import time from sheet
  structure and stored for export.
  Feature 003 overwrites the whole cell:
  SINGLE -> "answer"; every 題組 slot ->
  "（k）answer" (k = subPart), including
  an unmarked numbered row (subPart 1).
  003 does NOT write to the stored cell:
  it re-locates (unit number, subPart) in
  a fresh parse of the tab (by sheetId).
end note

note bottom of Submission
  Feature 002. Inside ONE transaction (BEGIN IMMEDIATE):
  phase = OPEN check, duplicate check, rank =
  1 + count(unit's submissions), insert (I).
  UNIQUE(unit_id, group_number): one per group per unit.
  UNIQUE(unit_id, rank): exactly one winner per unit.
  Answers: one per slot of the unit, all non-empty.
  Never sent to students of other groups before
  CLOSED, rank never sent to students in 002 (III).
  003: read only. Other groups' answers and every
  rank reach students only once phase = CLOSED.
end note

note right of Participant
  Feature 002. One student's membership in one
  group of one activity (no accounts). The browser
  keeps a random token (HttpOnly cookie); only its
  hash is stored. The group is derived from the
  token, never from the request (FR-014).
  Leaving / changing group: DRAFT only (deleted).
  Also deleted when its DRAFT activity is cancelled.
  displayName is student data: never logged.
end note

note left of Group
  Feature 002. A value, not a table: identified by
  (activity, number), number in 1..groupCount.
  participants and submissions store group_number.
  May have no members.
end note

note left of QuestionUnit
  kind = GROUP_SET (題組) when it has
  2+ slots, otherwise SINGLE.
end note

package "Transient import types (not stored)" <<Rectangle>> {
  class SpreadsheetInfo {
    spreadsheetId : str
    title : str
    tabs : TabInfo[]
    requestedGid : int | None
    preselectedSheetId() : int
  }
  class TabInfo {
    sheetId : int
    title : str
    index : int
  }
  class TabData {
    spreadsheetId : str
    spreadsheetTitle : str
    sheetId : int
    title : str
    grid : str[][]
    merges : (r0, r1, c0, c1)[]
  }
  class ImportPreview {
    header : HeaderInfo | None
    units : ParsedUnit[]
    issues : Issue[]
    spreadsheetId, sheetId, tabTitle
    fingerprint : str
    canConfirm() : bool
  }
  class HeaderInfo {
    row : int
    numberColumn : int
    answerColumn : int
  }
  class ParsedUnit {
    number : int
    kind : UnitKind
    sourceRow : int
  }
  class ParsedSlot {
    subPart : int
    row : int
    column : int
    a1Ref : str
    existingText : str
  }
  class Issue {
    severity : error | warning
    code : str
    message : str
    cells : str[]
    rows : int[]
  }
}

SpreadsheetInfo *-- TabInfo
ImportPreview *-- HeaderInfo
ImportPreview *-- ParsedUnit
ImportPreview *-- Issue
ParsedUnit *-- ParsedSlot

package "Transient results / export types (003, not stored)" <<Rectangle>> {
  class ActivityResults {
    activityId : int
    title : str
    units : UnitResult[]
  }
  class UnitResult {
    number : int
    kind : UnitKind
    entries : ResultEntry[] {rank order}
    winner() : ResultEntry | None
    noAnswer() : bool {無人作答}
  }
  class ResultEntry {
    rank : int
    groupNumber : int
    isWinner : bool
    answers : (subPart, text)[]
    submitterName : str {teacher only}
    receivedAt : str {teacher only}
  }
  class StudentResults <<view>> {
    units : (number, kind,\n entries without\n submitterName / receivedAt)[]
  }
  class PastActivitySummary {
    activityId : int
    title : str
    createdAt : str
    groupCount : int
    unitCount : int
    submissionCount : int
  }
  class CellWrite {
    a1Ref : str {from the RE-PARSED slot}
    text : str {RAW}
  }
  class ExportReport {
    cellsWritten : int
    unitsWritten : int
    unitsSkipped : int {no winner}
  }
  class ExportProblem {
    kind : parse_error | missing_question\n | missing_sub_part
    questionNumber : int | None
    subPart : int | None
    code : str | None {001 issue code}
    message : str
  }
}

ActivityResults *-- UnitResult
UnitResult *-- ResultEntry
ActivityResults ..> StudentResults : projected by student_view()
ExportReport ..> CellWrite : built from

note bottom of ExportProblem
  Any ExportProblem aborts the export:
  zero CellWrites are sent (003 FR-009).
  Raised as ExportBlocked(problems[]).
end note

package "In memory (lost on server restart)" <<Rectangle>> {
  class TeacherSessions {
    tokens : set<str>
    create(passcode) : str
    is_valid(token) : bool
  }
  class StudentKey <<NamedTuple>> {
    activityId : int
    participantId : int
    groupNumber : int
  }
}

note bottom of StudentKey
  Feature 002. Key of a /ws/student socket in
  RealtimeHub, resolved once from the
  qb_participant cookie at connect (or None).
end note

note bottom of TeacherSessions
  Feature 002. create() compares the passcode
  with TEACHER_PASSCODE (constant time) and
  issues a random token (HttpOnly cookie).
  The passcode itself is never stored or logged.
end note
@enduml
